    Then $\sQ(f) = \Omega\rbra{\frac{mm'}{\ell\ell'}}$.

Let $f : \zone^n \to \zone$ and $x \in \zoneu$. A partial assignment $p \in \cbra{0, 1, \su, *}^n$ is called a \emph{certificate} for $\uf$ at $x$ if 
