    \item $x$ is consistent with $p$, and
    \item $\uf(y) = \uf(x)$ for all $y$ consistent with $p$.
\end{itemize}
The size of this certificate is $|p| := \abs{\cbra{i \in [n] : p_i \neq *}}$. The \emph{domain of $p$} is said to be $\cbra{i \in [n] : p_i \neq *}$.

