1 & \textrm{ if } \exists j : x_{jk+1}=\cdots=x_{jk+k}=1
\quad \& \quad
x_i=0 \text{ for all } i \notin \{jk+1,\ldots,jk+k\}\\
0 & \textrm{ otherwise }
