Let $n \in \mathbb{N}$ and $\Gamma$ be a constraint language containing $k$-ary relations over the domain $[q]$. For $a,b \in [q]^n$, define $(a,b)\in \equivr$ if every instance of $\CSP(\Gamma)$ on $n$ variables that is satisfied by $a$ is also satisfied by $b$. Then $\equivr$ is an equivalence relation on $[q]^n$.

