\IC(\Pi') \leq O\left(\frac{\log(1/\delta)}{\big(\frac{1}{2}-\eps\big)^2}\cdot  \IC(\Pi)\right) \quad \textrm{and} \quad 
\CC(\Pi') \leq O\left(\frac{\log(1/\delta)}{\big(\frac{1}{2}-\eps\big)^2}\cdot  \CC(\Pi)\right). 
