  \Paren{R\cdot \max_h \pE_h \snorm{G_\cU h}}^{1/8}\mcom
\end{displaymath}
where the maximum is over all level-$d/2$ fictitious random variables $h$ over
$L_2(V\times [R])$ satisfying $h^2\sle h$ and $\pE_h (\E h)^{d/2}\le
\ell/R^{d/2}$.

